      ],
      "source": "https://sheboyganfalls.org/history-of-falls/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Downtown Sheboygan Falls Historic District, designated in 1984, preserves the town’s 19th‑century industrial charm.",
